  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">St&#xf6;d till studie f&#xf6;r att ta fram kvinnors privatfinansierade direkta  och indirekta kostnader av os&#xe4;kra aborter samt ber&#xe4;kning av kostnader f&#xf6;r Ugandas h&#xe4;lsosystem att behandla komplikationer av desamma.&#xc4;ven   ber&#xe4;kning av kostnader f&#xf6;r &#xf6;kad preventivmedelr&#xe5;dgivning och service  i relation till kostnader f&#xf6;r behandling av komplikationer.Studien    g&#xf6;rs i Uganda av The Guttmacher Institute.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Support to a study to examine unsafe abortion affects for individual  and household economic well being; direct costs by out-of pocket;     indirectg costs (income abd time loss). To examine the costs to the   Ugandan health care systm of treating complications and to assess the costs of increased contraceptive services to prevent unsafe abortion. The study is done by Guttmacher Institute.</narrative>
  </description>
